 G('Biografia empresarial: generalizar e narrar',['Função','Estrutura','Exemplo'],[['generalizar','For the most part, / By and large,','**For the most part, she used savings.**'],['sequenciar','Hardly had… when','**Hardly had it turned a profit when she reinvested.**'],['somar','Not only did… but also','**Not only did she expand, but she also kept staff.**'],['avaliar o passado','Had + sujeito + particípio…','**Had she taken funding earlier, she might have grown faster.**']],'**For the most part** generaliza **com ressalva**: “na maior parte”. Combine com dados concretos.'),
