 ('Profile interview',[('Ana','How did you fund the firm?','Como financiou a empresa?'),('Leo','For the most part, with my savings.','Na maior parte, com minhas economias.'),('Ana','Did you grow quickly?','Cresceu rápido?'),('Leo','Not only did we expand, but we also kept turnover low.','Não só expandimos, como mantivemos a rotatividade baixa.')]),
 [('Generalize.','Generalize.','For the most part, I enjoy my work.'),('Use hardly … when.','Use.','Hardly had we started when it ended.'),('Reflect on the past.','Reflita.','Had I known, I would have waited.')],
 ('Write a 8-sentence biography of an entrepreneur (real or fictional) using for the most part, hardly… when, not only… but also and a past conditional.','Isadora Lemos founded a logistics start-up at 29. For the most part, she funded it with savings. Hardly had the company turned a profit when she reinvested everything. Not only did she expand to three countries, but she also kept turnover below 5%. She attributes her success to disciplined planning. Had she taken outside funding earlier, she might have grown faster. However, she would have lost control. Today she advises other founders.',['Usei **For the most part…**','Usei **inversão**','8 frases'],'8 frases'),
