 ('Reading · An interview',iv('A project manager reviews a hectic year.',[('Interviewer: How was the launch?','**Hardly had** we announced the date **when** the orders poured in. **No sooner had** the system recovered **than** a second wave arrived. **Scarcely** a day passed without a crisis.'),('Interviewer: What did you learn?','**Hardly ever** do plans survive contact with reality. **Had** we **planned** for peaks, we **would have coped**. Nowadays, **barely** a week goes by without a stress test.')],gloss=[('order','pedido'),('pour in','chegar em grande quantidade'),('cope','dar conta'),('peak','pico')])),
