 [('Can you distinguish a trend ___ a fad? (from)','from','distinguish from.',None),('Differentiate ___ risk and opportunity. (between)','between','differentiate between.',None),('Draw a clear ___ between them. (distinction)','distinction','substantivo.',None),('What ___ us from competitors is evidence. (distinguishes)','distinguishes','verbo.',None)],
