 ('Consulting call',[('Ana','How can you tell a trend from a fad?','Como distinguir uma tendência de uma moda?'),('Leo','We differentiate between spikes and structural change.','Diferenciamos picos de mudanças estruturais.'),('Ana','What distinguishes you from competitors?','O que distingue vocês dos concorrentes?'),('Leo','Evidence, not slogans.','Evidências, não slogans.')]),
 [('Distinguish two things.','Distinga.','I can’t distinguish copper from gold.'),('Draw a distinction.','Faça.','We draw a distinction between cost and value.'),('Use tell … from.','Use.','Can you tell the real from the fake?')],
 ('Write a 5-line consultancy ad using distinguish from, differentiate between and draw a distinction.','Can you distinguish a trend from a fad? We help executives tell noise from signal. Our analysts differentiate between short-term spikes and structural change. We draw a clear distinction between risk and opportunity. What distinguishes us from competitors is evidence, not slogans.',['Usei **distinguish from**','Usei **differentiate between**','5 linhas'],'5 linhas'),
