 ('Reading · A "recipe" for a negotiation',text('Recipe: A Successful Negotiation',['**Ingredients:** preparation, patience and a clear limit. **Step 1.** Research the other side; **hardly ever** does a deal succeed without it. **Step 2.** Open with common ground; **only then** make your request. **Step 3.** Listen: **not until** you understand their needs **should** you propose terms.','**Step 4.** Remember that it all **comes down to** trust. **Step 5.** Close by confirming points in writing; **under no circumstances** leave details vague.'],kicker='HOW-TO',by='Negotiation Lab',gloss=[('common ground','pontos em comum'),('terms','condições'),('limit','limite'),('patience','paciência')])),
 [('Preparation is one of the ingredients.','T','preparation, patience.'),('You should propose terms before listening.','F','Not until you understand their needs.'),('Details should stay vague.','F','under no circumstances.')],
 [('“common ground” = ?',['pontos em comum','terreno comum','chão comum'],0,'common ground.'),('“terms” (of a deal) = ?',['condições','termos de aula','períodos'],0,'propose terms.')],
 G('Instruções com inversão e come down to',['Estrutura','Exemplo'],[['Hardly ever + auxiliar + sujeito','**Hardly ever does a deal succeed without research.**'],['Only then + auxiliar','**Only then make your request.**'],['Not until… should/do','**Not until you understand should you propose.**'],['come down to','**It all comes down to trust.**']],'**come down to** = resumir-se a: *It comes down to price.* No imperativo, a inversão em **only then / not until** dá ênfase ao passo.'),
 [('It all comes ___ to trust. (down)','down','come down to.',None),('Only ___ make your request. (then)','then','only then.',None),('Not until you understand ___ you propose terms. (should)','should','inversão.',None),('Under no ___ leave details vague. (circumstances)','circumstances','inversão.',None)],
