 ('Negotiation coach',[('Ana','What does it come down to in a negotiation?','A que se resume uma negociação?'),('Leo','Trust, mostly. And preparation.','À confiança, principalmente. E à preparação.'),('Ana','When do I propose terms?','Quando proponho condições?'),('Leo','Not until you understand their needs.','Só depois de entender as necessidades deles.')]),
 [('Use come down to.','Use.','It comes down to price.'),('Use only then.','Use.','Only then did I understand.'),('Give a step.','Dê.','First, research the other side.')],
 ('Write 5 steps of a "recipe" for a job interview using come down to and at least one inversion.','Ingredients: preparation, practice and calm. Step 1. Research the company; hardly ever does an interview succeed without it. Step 2. Rehearse answers aloud. Step 3. Listen carefully: only then answer. Step 4. It all comes down to showing value. Step 5. Send a thank-you note.',['Usei **come down to**','Usei **inversão**','5 passos'],'5 passos'),
