 ('Reading · A reflective blog',text('Blog: Decisions I’d Make Differently',['**Had I known** how demanding the role would be, I would have asked for more support. **Should you ever face** a similar offer, negotiate first. **Were I to start again**, I would choose clarity over prestige.','**Had it not been for** my mentor, I would have quit. **Should you feel lost**, speak to someone before deciding.'],kicker='BLOG',by='Reflections at Work',gloss=[('demanding','exigente'),('prestige','prestígio'),('quit','desistir'),('negotiate','negociar')])),
