Q('C1-L027','Report — model',
 'eu consigo reconhecer e imitar a estrutura de um relatório (Introduction, Findings, Conclusions, Recommendations) a partir de uma resenha de relatório.',
 ('Reading · A review of a report',text('Review: “Remote Teams: Findings and Recommendations” ★★★★☆',['This clear report follows the standard structure. The **Introduction** states the aim; **Findings** are presented with figures; **Conclusions** summarise the evidence; and **Recommendations** are practical. **Scarcely any** section is padded.','Its main weakness is the sample: only 60 firms took part. Nonetheless, **it is recommended that** managers set clear goals, **and that** meetings be shortened.'],kicker='REVIEW',by='Reviewed by Prof. Pires',gloss=[('findings','resultados'),('padded','enchido'),('weakness','fraqueza'),('sample','amostra')])),
 [('The report follows a standard structure.','T','standard structure.'),('Many sections are padded.','F','Scarcely any section is padded.'),('The sample included 600 firms.','F','only 60 firms.')],
 [('“findings” = ?',['resultados, achados','encontros','finais'],0,'Findings.'),('“padded” = ?',['enchido, inflado','acolchoado só','pago'],0,'padded.')],
 G('Estrutura de um relatório (report)',['Seção','Conteúdo','Linguagem'],[['Introduction','objetivo e contexto','**The aim of this report is to…**'],['Findings','dados e resultados','**The survey shows that… / Figures indicate…**'],['Conclusions','o que os dados significam','**It can be concluded that…**'],['Recommendations','ações propostas','**It is recommended that managers set…**']],'Relatórios usam **títulos**, **linguagem impessoal** (passiva) e **dados**. Para recomendar: **it is recommended that + base**.'),
 [('The ___ of this report is to review remote work. (aim)','aim','introdução.',None),('The survey ___ that 60% prefer hybrid work. (show)','shows','findings.',None),('It is recommended that managers ___ clear goals. (set)','set','subjuntivo / base.',None),('Findings are ___ with figures. (present, passive)','presented','passiva.',None)],
 V('report structure=estrutura de relatório|report aim=objetivo do relatório|survey figures=números da pesquisa|sample weakness=fraqueza da amostra|section heading=título de seção|impersonal style=estilo impessoal|formal register=registro formal|clear recommendation=recomendação clara|findings section=seção de resultados|conclusions section=seção de conclusões|executive overview=visão geral executiva|supporting figures=dados de apoio|report appendix=apêndice do relatório|methodology note=nota de metodologia|response rate=taxa de resposta|firm participation=participação das empresas|report review=resenha de relatório|critical comment=comentário crítico|padding=enchimento|evidence quality=qualidade da evidência|action proposal=proposta de ação|sample size=tamanho da amostra|remote team=equipe remota|team goals=metas da equipe|meeting length=duração das reuniões|follow-up study=estudo de acompanhamento|practical advice=conselho prático|decision basis=base de decisão'),
 ('Seminar',[('Ana','What are the main sections of a report?','Quais as seções principais de um relatório?'),('Leo','Introduction, findings, conclusions and recommendations.','Introdução, resultados, conclusões e recomendações.'),('Ana','How do we make a recommendation?','Como fazemos uma recomendação?'),('Leo','It is recommended that managers set clear goals.','Recomenda-se que os gerentes definam metas claras.')]),
 [('State the aim.','Declare.','The aim of this report is to assess costs.'),('Present a finding.','Apresente.','The survey shows that most staff prefer flexibility.'),('Recommend.','Recomende.','It is recommended that meetings be shortened.')],
 ('Write a short report (Introduction, Findings, Conclusions, Recommendations) of 8 sentences on meeting length.','Introduction: The aim of this report is to examine meeting length. Findings: The survey shows that meetings average 70 minutes. Most staff say they lose focus after 30. Conclusions: Long meetings reduce productivity. Recommendations: It is recommended that meetings be limited to 30 minutes. It is also recommended that agendas be circulated in advance. A follow-up survey should be conducted in six months.',['Usei **4 seções**','Usei **it is recommended that**'],'8 frases'),
 verbs=[('recommend','recomendar','I recommend a review.','Recomendo uma revisão.')],expr=[('The aim of this report is…','O objetivo deste relatório é…'),('It can be concluded that…','Pode-se concluir que…'),('Figures indicate that…','Os números indicam que…'),('Attention should be drawn to…','Deve-se chamar a atenção para…'),('In view of the above,…','Diante do exposto,…'),('It is advisable that…','É aconselhável que…'),('Further action is required.','É necessária mais ação.'),('As outlined above,…','Como descrito acima,…')])
Q('C1-L028','Key verb: make — meanings',
 'eu consigo usar make em contextos C1 (make up, make out, make do, make for, make off with, make a case) num conto, e usar infer e On the grounds that…',
 ('Reading · A short story',text('Story: The Missing Ledger',['Marta could not **make out** the handwriting, but she **inferred** that the entries had been changed. She **made a case** to the board **on the grounds that** the totals did not add up. Nobody wanted to **make a fuss**.','The accountant had **made off with** the original ledger. Without it, they had to **make do** with copies. In the end, the evidence **made for** a clear conclusion: someone had **made up** the figures.'],kicker='SHORT STORY',by='Original story',gloss=[('ledger','livro-razão'),('entry','lançamento'),('accountant','contador'),('handwriting','caligrafia')])),
 [('Marta read the handwriting easily.','F','could not make out.'),('The accountant took the original ledger.','T','made off with.'),('Someone invented figures.','T','made up the figures.')],
 [('“ledger” = ?',['livro-razão','ledger só','legenda'],0,'the ledger.'),('“infer” = ?',['inferir','inferno','informar'],0,'inferred.')],
 G('Verbo-chave: make',['Expressão','Significado','Exemplo'],[['make out','distinguir; entender','**I can’t make out the text.**'],['make up','inventar; compensar','**He made up the figures.**'],['make do (with)','virar-se com o que há','**We made do with copies.**'],['make for','contribuir para; dirigir-se a','**Evidence made for a clear conclusion.**'],['make off with','fugir levando','**He made off with the ledger.**'],['make a case','argumentar','**She made a case to the board.**']],'**on the grounds that** = com base no fato de que (justificativa formal). **infer** = deduzir a partir de indícios.'),
 [('She could not make ___ the handwriting. (out)','out','make out.',None),('He made ___ the figures. (up)','up','inventar.',None),('They had to make ___ with copies. (do)','do','make do.',None),('She made a case ___ the grounds that totals did not add up. (on)','on','on the grounds that.',None)],
 V('missing ledger=livro-razão desaparecido|altered entry=lançamento alterado|accounting fraud=fraude contábil|forensic audit=auditoria forense|handwriting analysis=análise de caligrafia|total mismatch=divergência de totais|board inquiry=inquérito do conselho|paper trail=rastro de documentos|original record=registro original|fabricated figure=número forjado|internal control=controle interno|ledger entry=lançamento contábil|finance department=departamento financeiro|audit finding=achado de auditoria|suspicious transaction=transação suspeita|document copy=cópia de documento|witness statement=depoimento de testemunha|evidence trail=trilha de evidências|accountant’s office=escritório do contador|hidden loss=perda oculta|financial scandal=escândalo financeiro|legal action=ação judicial|forensic accountant=contador forense|fraud suspicion=suspeita de fraude|story twist=reviravolta da história|dramatic clue=pista dramática|closing scene=cena final|culprit=culpado'),
 ('Story club',[('Ana','Could Marta read the handwriting?','A Marta conseguiu ler a caligrafia?'),('Leo','No, she couldn’t make it out, but she inferred the entries were changed.','Não, não conseguiu decifrar, mas inferiu que os lançamentos foram alterados.'),('Ana','Why did she make a case to the board?','Por que ela apresentou o caso ao conselho?'),('Leo','On the grounds that the totals did not add up.','Com base em que os totais não batiam.')]),
 [('Use make out.','Use.','I can’t make out his words.'),('Use make up.','Use.','Don’t make up excuses.'),('Use make a case.','Use.','She made a case for change.')],
 ('Write a 7-sentence mystery paragraph using make out, make up, make do, make off with and infer.','Marta could not make out the handwriting, but she inferred that the entries had been changed. She made a case to the board on the grounds that the totals did not add up. The accountant had made off with the original ledger. They had to make do with copies. In the end, it was clear that someone had made up the figures. Nobody was surprised.',['Usei **make out / up / do / off with**','Usei **infer**','7 frases'],'7 frases'),
 verbs=[('infer','inferir, deduzir','We infer meaning from context.','Inferimos o sentido pelo contexto.')],pv=[('make out','distinguir; entender','I can’t make out the words.','Não consigo distinguir as palavras.'),('make up','inventar; compensar','He made up a story.','Ele inventou uma história.'),('make do','virar-se com o que há','We made do with less.','Nos viramos com menos.'),('make off with','fugir com','He made off with the cash.','Ele fugiu com o dinheiro.')],
 expr=[('On the grounds that…','Com base no fato de que…'),('Make a fuss.','Fazer alarde.'),('Make ends meet.','Pagar as contas.'),('Make waves.','Causar polêmica.'),('Make a killing.','Ganhar uma fortuna.'),('Make headway.','Progredir.'),('Make light of.','Minimizar.'),('Make sense of.','Entender o sentido de.')])
